      {{/* gh repo delete/archive are irreversible remote ops with no legitimate agent use — hard-blocked in deny (not merely ask) for parity with the publish/force-push tier above. deny cannot be click-through-approved like ask. Reversible gh repo verbs (create/edit/fork/rename/sync) stay in ask. */ -}}
      "Bash(gh repo delete:*)",
      "Bash(gh repo archive:*)",
      "Edit(/etc/**)",
      "Edit(/usr/**)",
      "Edit(/var/**)",
      "Edit(/opt/**)",
      "Edit(/bin/**)",
